{"from": "claim:ac-22-09-companions-light", "type": "related_to", "to": "claim:ac-09-07-companions-sound", "note": "Acts 9:7: the companions 'heard the sound but saw no one'; Acts 22:9: they 'saw the light and were afraid, but did not understand the voice' - a discrepancy between the two retellings of the same event."}
{"from": "claim:ac-22-12-ananias-devout", "type": "related_to", "to": "claim:ac-09-10-ananias-vision", "note": "The same disciple Ananias of Damascus; Acts 22:12 adds that he was devout according to the law and well reported of by all the Jews of Damascus, details Acts 9 does not give."}
