{"from": "claim:ac-22-16-baptism", "type": "related_to", "to": "claim:ac-09-12-18-scales-sight-baptism", "note": "The same baptism: Acts 9:18 narrates the laying on of hands, sight restored, and baptism; Acts 22:16 preserves Ananias's command 'be baptized, and wash away your sins, calling on the name of the Lord' - the command itself is only in the 22 telling."}
